   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set(style=\"darkgrid\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `import pandas as pd`：pandas 是处理表格数据的库，约定俗成简写成 `pd`。表格对象叫 `DataFrame`。\n",
    "> - `import numpy as np`：numpy 负责数值计算（数组、对数、随机数等）。\n",
    "> - `import matplotlib.pyplot as plt`：最底层的画图库，`plt` 负责画布和坐标轴。\n",
    "> - `import seaborn as sns`：基于 matplotlib 的高层画图库，专门为统计图设计，语法更短。\n",
    "> - `%matplotlib inline`：Jupyter 魔法命令，让图直接显示在单元格下方。\n",
    "> - `sns.set(style=\"darkgrid\")`：设置全局配色主题。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 第 0 部分　准备工作（1 分）"
