    "%%time\n",
    "train_data[\"log_trip_duration\"] = np.log1p(train_data[\"trip_duration\"].values)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(15, 6))\n",
    "plt.hist(train_data[\"log_trip_duration\"].values, bins=100)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"log(trip_duration + 1)\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"number of train records\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Target after the log transform\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `np.log1p(数组)` = `log(1 + 数组)`。专门为了处理\"可能为 0 的值\"而设计，比手写 `np.log(x+1)` 在数值上更稳定。\n",
    "> - `train_data[\"log_trip_duration\"] = ...`：新增一列。pandas 里给不存在的列赋值就是\"新建列\"。\n",
    "> - 后面那个 `plt.hist(...)` 直接传 numpy 数组，画 100 个区间。你会看到分布变得更像钟形——这就是取对数的效果。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
