      "constant prediction, log space : 6.4670\n",
      "constant prediction, seconds   : 642.5\n",
      "RMSLE of the constant model    : 0.7958\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# the best constant prediction is the mean of the log target\n",
    "const_pred = train_data[\"log_trip_duration\"].mean()\n",
    "const_rmsle = np.sqrt(np.mean((train_data[\"log_trip_duration\"] - const_pred) ** 2))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"constant prediction, log space : {const_pred:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"constant prediction, seconds   : {np.expm1(const_pred):.1f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"RMSLE of the constant model    : {const_rmsle:.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `train_data[\"log_trip_duration\"].mean()`：对**对数**求平均。因为 RMSLE 在对数空间度量误差，所以\"最优常数预测\"就是对数均值。\n",
    "> - `np.expm1(x)` = `exp(x) - 1`，正好是 `log1p` 的逆运算，用来把对数还原成秒。\n",
    "> - `np.sqrt(np.mean(...))`：手写 RMSE 的三步——先算平方误差、再求平均、最后开根号。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:17.963113Z",
