   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `train_data[train_data[\"doy\"].between(22, 25) | train_data[\"doy\"].between(149, 152)]`：按条件筛选行。`between(a, b)` 是\"包含两端\"的闭区间，`|` 表示\"或\"（对应 `&` 是\"且\"，注意两边都要加括号）。\n",
    "> - `.groupby(\"doy\").size()`：看看这几个特殊日子各有几单，用来确认\"下跌\"确实存在。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:18.534186Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:18.534036Z",
