    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# two anomalous periods: the January blizzard and the Memorial Day weekend\n",
    "train_data[\"anomaly_1\"] = train_data[\"doy\"].between(23, 24).astype(int)\n",
    "train_data[\"anomaly_2\"] = train_data[\"doy\"].between(150, 151).astype(int)\n",
    "train_data[\"anomaly\"] = (train_data[\"anomaly_1\"] | train_data[\"anomaly_2\"]).astype(int)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：造两个二元标记（0/1），对应两次异常。\n",
    "> - `.between(23, 24).astype(int)`：先得到 True/False，`.astype(int)` 把 True 变成 1、False 变成 0。\n",
    "> - `anomaly_1 | anomaly_2` 两个 0/1 序列做\"或\"，任何一边是 1 结果就是 1。\n",
    "> - 为什么要**分开**记两个标记而不是合成一个？因为两次事件的原因不同（一次暴雪、一次假期），对模型的含义也不同；合成一个会让模型以为它们是一类事。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:18.551436Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:18.551281Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:18.560561Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:18.558739Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "anomaly_1     5031\n",
       "anomaly_2    11942\n",
       "anomaly      16973\n",
       "dtype: int64"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 28,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "train_data[[\"anomaly_1\", \"anomaly_2\", \"anomaly\"]].sum()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`train_data[[\"anomaly_1\",\"anomaly_2\",\"anomaly\"]]` 用**双层方括号**选多列（单层是选一列）。`.sum()` 对每列求和——因为值只有 0 和 1，求和恰好等于\"标记为 1 的行数\"。"
   ]
