    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "\n",
    "train_data[\"log_dur\"] = np.log1p(train_data[\"trip_duration\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "train, valid = train_test_split(train_data, test_size=0.3, random_state=42)\n",
    "print(\"train:\", train.shape, \"valid:\", valid.shape)\n",
    "\n",
    "for col, title in [(\"dow\", \"day of week\"), (\"hour\", \"hour of day\"), (\"doy\", \"day of year\")]:\n",
    "    g = train.groupby(col)[\"log_dur\"].mean().reset_index()\n",
    "    sns.relplot(data=g, x=col, y=\"log_dur\", kind=\"line\", height=4, aspect=3)\n",
    "    plt.title(f\"mean log(trip_duration) by {title}\")\n",
    "    plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split` 导入\"切分数据集\"的函数。它后面会被反复用到：随机把数据分成\"训练用\"和\"检验用\"两份。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.641547Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.641127Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.645117Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.643749Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：第二次导入同一个函数（原模板重复了），无副作用。紧接着这一格做的是**真正的一次切分**：\n",
    "> - `train_test_split(train_data, test_size=0.3, random_state=42)`：把整个表按 7:3 随机分成两份。\n",
    "> - `random_state=42` 是\"随机种子\"——固定它，每次运行得到的切分完全一样，结果才可复现。写 42 只是程序员的习惯梗。\n",
    "> - 得到的 `train` 用来探索规律，`valid` 留作检验。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.647627Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.647287Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.674223Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.672567Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n",
    "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import Ridge, Lasso\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def make_pipeline(model, num_cols, cat_cols):\n",
    "    \"\"\"OneHot for categoricals, StandardScaler for numerics, then the model.\"\"\"\n",
    "    pre = ColumnTransformer(\n",
    "        [\n",
    "            (\"num\", StandardScaler(), list(num_cols)),\n",
    "            (\"cat\", OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\"ignore\", dtype=np.float64), list(cat_cols)),\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        sparse_threshold=1.0,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return Pipeline([(\"pre\", pre), (\"model\", model)])\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def fit_score(model, num_cols, cat_cols, X_tr, y_tr, X_te, y_te):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Fit the pipeline and return it together with the hold-out RMSLE.\"\"\"\n",
    "    pipe = make_pipeline(model, num_cols, cat_cols)\n",
    "    pipe.fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n",
    "    pred = np.clip(pipe.predict(X_te), 0.0, 12.0)\n",
    "    rmsle = float(np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_te, pred)))\n",
    "    return pipe, rmsle\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def evaluate(num_cols, cat_cols, model=None, label=\"\", X_data=None, y_data=None):\n",
    "    \"\"\"70/30 hold-out evaluation with a fixed random state, so runs are comparable.\"\"\"\n",
    "    Xd = X if X_data is None else X_data\n",
    "    yd = y if y_data is None else y_data\n",
    "    idx = np.arange(len(Xd))\n",
    "    tr, te = train_test_split(idx, test_size=0.3, random_state=42)\n",
    "    model = Ridge(alpha=1.0) if model is None else model\n",
    "    pipe, score = fit_score(model, num_cols, cat_cols,\n",
    "                            Xd.iloc[tr], yd.iloc[tr], Xd.iloc[te], yd.iloc[te])\n",
    "    print(f\"{label:45s} RMSLE = {score:.4f}\")\n",
    "    return pipe, score"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：这一格是整份 notebook 的\"工具箱\"，定义了四个东西。\n",
    "> - `ColumnTransformer`：**按列分流**的处理器。你告诉它\"这几列做标准化、那几列做独热编码\"，它就会分别处理再拼起来。表格里数值列和类别列混在一起时，这是标准做法。\n",
    "> - `OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\"ignore\")`：独热编码器。`handle_unknown=\"ignore\"` 意思是\"遇到训练时没见过的类别，就当作全 0\"，否则预测时会直接报错。\n",
    "> - `StandardScaler`：标准化，把一列变成\"均值 0、标准差 1\"。\n",
    "> - `Pipeline`：把\"预处理 + 模型\"打包成一个整体。好处是 `fit` 时预处理只在训练集上算参数，`predict` 时自动复用，**避免数据泄漏**。\n",
    "> - `make_pipeline(model, num_cols, cat_cols)`：自建的小函数，把上面几样拼起来。\n",
    "> - `fit_score(...)`：训练并返回\"测试集上的 RMSLE\"。注意 `np.clip(预测值, 0.0, 12.0)`——把预测值裁剪到 `[0, 12]`，因为对数时长落在这个范围内（`exp(12)` 约 16 万秒，足够了），防止极端预测把分数带偏。\n",
    "> - `evaluate(...)`：再包一层，固定 70/30 的切分，让**所有实验在同一批数据上比较**——这是做对比实验的纪律。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.676032Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.675867Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.690081Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:20.688433Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0    6.122493\n",
       "1    6.498282\n",
       "2    7.661527\n",
