   "source": [
    "# OneHotEncoder inside the pipeline does what pd.get_dummies did in the draft, but it\n",
    "# remembers the categories seen during fit and ignores categories unseen at transform\n",
    "# time, which is what we need for the hold-out split.\n",
    "print(sorted(date_cat))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：原模板这里用 `pd.get_dummies` 手工做独热。我们改成了在 `Pipeline` 里用 `OneHotEncoder`，区别是：\n",
    "> - `get_dummies` 每次都对当前数据重新编码，训练集和测试集的列可能对不上；\n",
    "> - `OneHotEncoder` 会\"记住\"训练时见过的类别，预测时按同一套列来，多出来的未知类别被安全地忽略。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.161568Z",
