   "source": [
    "## 第 2 部分　研究坐标（3 分）\n",
    "\n",
    "我们已经把\"上车时间\"研究得比较透了，现在来看上下车的坐标。下面给了一个现成的函数，用来把行程的起点或终点画在地图上。注意：**只传一小部分数据**进去，否则函数会跑很久（它要一行一行地画圆圈）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.177641Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.177513Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.181795Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.180336Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def show_circles_on_map(data, latitude_column, longitude_column, color):\n",
    "    location = (data[latitude_column].mean(), data[longitude_column].mean())\n",
    "    m = folium.Map(location=location)\n",
    "    for _, row in data.iterrows():\n",
    "        folium.Circle(radius=100,\n",
    "                      location=(row[latitude_column], row[longitude_column]),\n",
    "                      color=color, fill_color=color, fill=True).add_to(m)\n",
    "    m.get_root().height = 480\n",
    "    return m"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`show_circles_on_map` 用 folium 把每条记录画成一个小圆。\n",
    "> - `data[latitude_column].mean()`：取所有点的平均坐标当地图中心。\n",
    "> - `data.iterrows()`：逐行遍历。**这就是它慢的原因**——1,000 行就要画 1,000 个对象，1.4 万行会卡死。\n",
    "> - `folium.Circle(radius=100, location=(lat, lon), color=..., fill=True)`：画半径 100 米、带填充的圆。\n",
    "> - `return m` 把地图对象返回，Jupyter 会自动渲染。"
   ]
  },
