   "source": [
    "from haversine import haversine_vector, Unit\n",
    "\n",
    "X[\"haversine\"] = haversine_vector(\n",
    "    train_data[[\"pickup_latitude\", \"pickup_longitude\"]].to_numpy(),\n",
    "    train_data[[\"dropoff_latitude\", \"dropoff_longitude\"]].to_numpy(),\n",
    "    unit=Unit.KILOMETERS,\n",
    ")\n",
    "X[[\"haversine\"]].describe()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`haversine_vector(起点数组, 终点数组, unit=Unit.KILOMETERS)` 是**向量化**版本——一次传入 145 万个点对，几秒钟算完。\n",
    "> - 传入的必须是形状为 `(n, 2)` 的数组，列顺序是 `(纬度, 经度)`。\n",
    "> - `X[\"haversine\"] = ...` 把结果写进特征表。\n",
    "> - `.describe()` 输出均值、四分位数、最大最小值，用来检查有没有算错（应该有 0 距离，但不应该有负数）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "因为我们预测的是时长的**对数**，并且希望特征和目标之间是线性关系，所以距离也要取对数：$\\log t = \\log s - \\log v_{\\text{平均}}$。把距离的对数单独存成一列："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.813048Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.812917Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.823459Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:22.821719Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
