    "# speed in km per hour, not per second\n",
    "X[\"speed\"] = X[\"haversine\"] / (train_data[\"trip_duration\"] / 3600.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.hist(X[\"speed\"], bins=200, log=True)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"average speed, km/h\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"count, log scale\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Average speed distribution (all objects)\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `X[\"haversine\"] / (train_data[\"trip_duration\"] / 3600.0)`：距离（公里）除以\"小时数\"，得到 km/h。如果直接除以秒，单位会变成 km/s，数字会小得没法看。\n",
    "> - `plt.hist(..., log=True)`：纵轴用对数刻度。因为绝大多数速度集中在 10–20 之间，少数极端值会把纵轴拉爆，取对数才能同时看清两头。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "可以看到，有些记录算出来的速度高得离谱。请只对\"速度合理\"的那部分记录画直方图（比如把高于某个分位数的记录排除掉）。"
