    "border = np.nanpercentile(X[\"speed\"], 95)\n",
    "normal_speed = X.loc[X[\"speed\"] < border, \"speed\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.hist(normal_speed, bins=100)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"average speed, km/h\")\n",
    "plt.title(f\"Average speed below the 95th percentile ({border:.1f} km/h)\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `np.nanpercentile(列, 95)`：计算第 95 百分位数（会忽略 NaN）。用它当\"不合理速度\"的门槛，比硬编码一个数字更稳。\n",
    "> - `X.loc[X[\"speed\"] < border, \"speed\"]`：只取低于门槛的那些速度，再画直方图。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "对每一对（星期几，小时）计算速度的**中位数**。用 `sns.heatmap` 画一张图：横轴是小时，纵轴是星期几，格子的颜色是中位数速度。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.226028Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.225879Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.230037Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.228287Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def heatmap(X_):\n",
    "    dw = pd.DataFrame({\"dayofweek\": X_[\"dayofweek\"], \"hour\": X_[\"hour\"], \"speed\": X_[\"speed\"]})\n",
    "    table = dw.pivot_table(index=\"dayofweek\", columns=\"hour\", values=\"speed\", aggfunc=\"median\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "    sns.heatmap(table, ax=ax, cmap=\"viridis\")\n",
    "    ax.set_title(\"Median speed, km/h, by day of week and hour\")\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel(\"hour\")\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel(\"day of week\")\n",
    "    plt.show()\n",
    "    return table"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`heatmap(X_)` 是个自制小函数。\n",
    "> - `pd.DataFrame({...})` 用字典建表，键是列名、值是列数据。\n",
    "> - `.pivot_table(index=..., columns=..., values=..., aggfunc=\"median\")`：**透视表**，把长表变成\"行×列\"的矩阵，格子里放中位数。这是\"分组统计再摊开\"的常用写法。\n",
    "> - `sns.heatmap(矩阵)`：把矩阵画成颜色块，颜色深浅代表数值大小。\n",
    "> - `return table` 把矩阵返回，后面的任务要复用。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.231845Z",
