  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：调用上面的函数，把 7×24 的中位数速度矩阵存进 `speed_table`。你会看到明显的\"夜晚深、白天浅\"的条纹。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "别忘了把速度这一列从数据里删掉！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**讲解与答案**\n",
    "\n",
    "**问题：为什么速度不能当特征？**\n",
    "\n",
    "因为速度 = `距离 ÷ 时长`，而**时长正是我们要预测的目标**。把速度放进特征，等于把答案的一部分塞给模型——这叫**目标泄漏**（target leakage）。\n",
    "\n",
    "具体地：一旦模型知道\"距离\"和\"速度\"，它可以直接算出时长（时长 = 距离 ÷ 速度），预测分数会好得离谱，但到了真正要预测的时候，你**根本不知道速度**（这正是要预测的东西）。这种模型在比赛中会\"训练时封神、测试时崩盘\"。\n",
    "\n",
    "**那怎么办？** 用\"典型速度\"而不是\"本次速度\"：先按（星期几，小时）统计训练集里**历史的中位数速度**，再把它当作一个\"这个时段大概多堵\"的标签传给模型。这个统计量只用到训练集的历史信息，不含当次行程的答案，所以是合法的。下一步的两格就是这么做的。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.442694Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.442498Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.447873Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.446729Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "speed column removed, remaining columns: 8\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "X = X.drop(columns=[\"speed\"])\n",
    "print(\"speed column removed, remaining columns:\", len(X.columns))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`X.drop(columns=[\"speed\"])` 删除一列，并**重新赋值给 X**（没有用 `inplace`，所以必须接住返回值）。删掉之后，特征表里就不含这个\"偷看答案\"的列了。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**问题**：*仔细看这张热力图，速度在什么时候最小？什么时候最大？*\n",
    "\n",
    "另外，请造两个标签：\"这趟行程是在堵车时段\"和\"这趟行程是在畅通时段\"（当然，它们**不能**依赖当次行程的速度）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**讲解与答案**\n",
    "\n",
    "**看图。** 热力图的纵轴是星期几（0=周一），横轴是小时：\n",
    "- 速度**最小**：周二到周四的上午 10–11 点，中位数约 **9.6 km/h**；周五的 17–18 点也很低（约 11 km/h）。\n",
    "- 速度**最大**：凌晨 4–6 点，能到 **20–24 km/h**。\n",
    "- 周末的\"早高峰\"消失了，最慢的时段挪到了下午。\n",
    "\n",
    "**为什么？** 工作日的上午十点看上去不是高峰，但那是\"路上车多、红灯多、短途多\"的时段；凌晨车少路空，速度自然快。\n",
    "\n",
    "**怎么造标签？** 关键是不能用当次行程的速度。正确做法：先算出\"（星期几，小时）→ 历史中位数速度\"这张表，然后看**这张表里的值**落在历史分布的低四分位还是高四分位，据此打\"堵 / 畅通\"标签。也就是说，标签来自\"这个时段通常有多堵\"，而不是\"这趟车当时多快\"。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.449606Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.449351Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.455567Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.454093Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "median speed table, km/h, first rows and columns:\n",
      "hour          0     1     2     3     4     5\n",
      "dayofweek                                    \n",
      "0          20.1  20.2  20.7  20.7  23.8  23.6\n",
      "1          18.9  20.0  20.4  21.8  23.2  22.8\n",
      "2          17.9  19.4  20.1  20.8  22.8  22.6\n",
      "25th percentile of the cell medians: 11.0 km/h\n",
      "75th percentile of the cell medians: 17.9 km/h\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(\"median speed table, km/h, first rows and columns:\")\n",
    "print(speed_table.round(1).iloc[:3, :6])\n",
    "\n",
    "low, high = speed_table.stack().quantile([0.25, 0.75])\n",
    "print(f\"25th percentile of the cell medians: {low:.1f} km/h\")\n",
    "print(f\"75th percentile of the cell medians: {high:.1f} km/h\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：打印速度矩阵的一小块（`.iloc[:3, :6]` 取前 3 行、前 6 列），再算整张表的 25% 和 75% 分位数，作为\"堵 / 畅通\"的阈值。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.457400Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.457182Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.479954Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.478341Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "jam share:  0.300\n",
      "free share: 0.088\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "jam_cells = (speed_table <= low).to_numpy()\n",
    "free_cells = (speed_table >= high).to_numpy()\n",
    "\n",
    "dow_idx = X[\"dayofweek\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "hour_idx = X[\"hour\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "\n",
    "X[\"is_jam\"] = jam_cells[dow_idx, hour_idx].astype(int)\n",
    "X[\"is_free\"] = free_cells[dow_idx, hour_idx].astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"jam share:  %.3f\" % X[\"is_jam\"].mean())\n",
    "print(\"free share: %.3f\" % X[\"is_free\"].mean())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：把\"堵 / 畅通\"标签贴到每条记录上，全程向量化。\n",
    "> - `(speed_table <= low).to_numpy()`：把\"格子是否属于最堵的四分之一\"变成一个 7×24 的布尔矩阵。\n",
    "> - `X[\"dayofweek\"].to_numpy()` 和 `X[\"hour\"].to_numpy()` 取出每条记录的星期和小时。\n",
    "> - `jam_cells[dow_idx, hour_idx]`：**花式索引**——用两个整数数组一次性从矩阵里取出 145 万个对应的值，没有循环，几毫秒完成。\n",
    "> - `.astype(int)` 把 True/False 变成 1/0。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**任务 8（0.25 分）**。前面提到，地图上有两个点远在曼哈顿之外。对这两个点，各给样本加两个特征：这趟行程是否**从这里出发**，是否**在这里结束**。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.482473Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.482287Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.538046Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:31:23.536344Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "the two far-away points:\n",
      "pickup_latitude  pickup_longitude\n",
      "40.774           -73.873             8632\n",
      "40.645           -73.782             7172\n",
      "Name: count, dtype: int64\n",
      "start_far: 69267 end_far: 31683\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "coords = train_data[[\"pickup_latitude\", \"pickup_longitude\", \"dropoff_latitude\", \"dropoff_longitude\"]]\n",
    "\n",
    "# objects outside the Manhattan rectangle\n",
    "manhattan = ((coords[\"pickup_latitude\"].between(40.70, 40.88))\n",
    "             & (coords[\"pickup_longitude\"].between(-74.02, -73.90)))\n",
    "\n",
    "# the two dominant clusters outside the rectangle (coordinates rounded to ~100 m)\n",
    "far_clusters = (coords.loc[~manhattan, [\"pickup_latitude\", \"pickup_longitude\"]]\n",
    "                .round(3).value_counts().head(2))\n",
    "print(\"the two far-away points:\")\n",
    "print(far_clusters)\n",
    "\n",
    "X[\"start_far\"] = 0\n",
    "X[\"end_far\"] = 0\n",
    "for (lat, lon), _ in far_clusters.items():\n",
    "    near_start = ((coords[\"pickup_latitude\"].sub(lat).abs() < 0.02)\n",
    "                  & (coords[\"pickup_longitude\"].sub(lon).abs() < 0.02))\n",
    "    near_end = ((coords[\"dropoff_latitude\"].sub(lat).abs() < 0.02)\n",
    "                & (coords[\"dropoff_longitude\"].sub(lon).abs() < 0.02))\n",
    "    X.loc[near_start, \"start_far\"] = 1\n",
    "    X.loc[near_end, \"end_far\"] = 1\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"start_far:\", int(X[\"start_far\"].sum()), \"end_far:\", int(X[\"end_far\"].sum()))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**\n",
    "> - `coords = train_data[[...]]`：把四个坐标列单独拎出来，避免污染特征表 `X`。\n",
    "> - `manhattan = (纬度在 40.70–40.88) & (经度在 -74.02 到 -73.90)`：定义一个\"曼哈顿矩形\"。`between` 是闭区间，`&` 是\"且\"，两边都要括号。\n",
    "> - `coords.loc[~manhattan, [...]]`：`~` 是取反，选出\"矩形之外\"的点；`.round(3)` 把坐标四舍五入到约 100 米，把同一地点的点聚成一簇；`.value_counts().head(2)` 数每簇有多少点，取最多的两簇。\n",
    "> - 接下来用 `.sub(lat).abs() < 0.02`（约 2 公里的容差）判断\"是否在这个点附近\"，然后 `X.loc[条件, \"start_far\"] = 1` 打标记。\n",
    "> - **注意**：不能用精确相等（`==`）去匹配坐标，因为浮点数几乎不会完全相等——这是初学者最常见的坑之一。"
   ]
  },
