   "source": [
    "grid = MapGridTransformer(n_rows=30, n_cols=30).fit(coords)\n",
    "cells = grid.transform(coords)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"bounding box (lat_min, lat_max, lon_min, lon_max):\", np.round(grid.bbox_, 3))\n",
    "print(\"outside the grid: start %.2f%%, end %.2f%%\"\n",
    "      % (100 * (cells[\"start_cell\"] == -1).mean(), 100 * (cells[\"end_cell\"] == -1).mean()))\n",
    "\n",
    "X[\"start_cell\"] = cells[\"start_cell\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "X[\"end_cell\"] = cells[\"end_cell\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "X[[\"start_cell\", \"end_cell\"]].head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`MapGridTransformer(...).fit(coords)` 用坐标训练出格子的边界，`.transform(coords)` 得到带 `start_cell` / `end_cell` 两列的新表。\n",
    "> - `grid.bbox_` 保存了矩形边界，打印出来能核对范围是否合理。\n",
    "> - `(cells[\"start_cell\"] == -1).mean()` 算出落在框外的比例：上车点 1.35%、下车点 2.46%（矩形按 0.5%–99.5% 分位点取的，所以两侧各留了半条尾巴在外面）。\n",
    "> - 最后把两列数值搬进特征表 `X`。"
   ]
