   "source": [
    "residual = y - pipe_all.predict(X)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(18, 4))\n",
    "axes[0].hist(y, bins=200)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"log(1 + trip_duration)\")\n",
    "axes[1].hist(X[\"haversine\"], bins=200)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"haversine, km\")\n",
    "axes[2].hist(residual, bins=200)\n",
    "axes[2].set_title(\"residuals of the current model\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"duration quantiles:\",\n",
    "      train_data[\"trip_duration\"].quantile([0.001, 0.01, 0.99, 0.999]).round(1).to_dict())\n",
    "print(\"residual quantiles:\", residual.quantile([0.01, 0.99]).round(3).to_dict())\n",
    "\n",
    "# keep an untouched copy: the real test set will contain the same kind of outliers\n",
    "X_full, y_full = X.copy(), y.copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "keep = (\n",
    "    train_data[\"trip_duration\"].between(10, 6 * 3600)      # no 1-second and no 6-hour \"city\" trips\n",
    "    & X[\"haversine\"].between(0.1, 100)                     # drop zero-distance and 100-km \"city\" trips\n",
    "    & residual.abs().between(0, 1.0)                       # drop the worst regression outliers\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"removed: %.2f%% of the sample\" % (100 * (~keep).mean()))\n",
    "\n",
    "X = X.loc[keep].reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "y = y.loc[keep].reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "coords = coords.loc[keep].reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "print(\"rows left:\", len(X))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：这一格做\"离群点清洗\"，是本作业最需要小心的地方。\n",
    "> - `residual = y - pipe_all.predict(X)`：残差 = 真实值 − 预测值。用现有模型对全量数据预测，看哪些记录错得离谱。\n",
    "> - 三张直方图分别看：目标分布、距离分布、残差分布。\n",
    "> - `.quantile([...]).round(1).to_dict()`：算分位数并四舍五入，转成字典打印，方便一眼看出量级。\n",
    "> - `X_full, y_full = X.copy(), y.copy()`：**在删数据之前先存一份完整的**。后面要用它来算\"诚实的\"分数——如果只留洗过的数据，就永远不知道模型在真实数据上有多差。\n",
    "> - `keep = A & B & C`：三个条件都满足才保留。`&` 表示\"且\"，每个条件都要加括号。\n",
    "> - `X.loc[keep].reset_index(drop=True)`：按条件筛选，然后**重置行号**。重置很重要——后面按行号取值（`.iloc`）时，行号必须是连续的 0,1,2…。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**讲解与答案**\n",
    "\n",
    "**删掉了什么。** 三类记录：\n",
    "1. 时长小于 10 秒的（司机点了两次表）；\n",
    "2. 直线距离大于 100 公里的\"市内行程\"（表忘了关）；\n",
    "3. 残差绝对值大于 1 的（模型完全解释不了的记录，对时长而言就是差了 e 倍以上）。\n",
    "\n",
    "一共删掉 **3.23%** 的数据——47,149 行，剩下 1,411,495 行。\n",
    "\n",
    "**两个数字要一起读。**\n",
    "- 在**洗过的**留出集上，RMSLE 是 0.3417，比 0.4985 好看得多——但这里有水分：留出集是用**同一套规则**洗过的。\n",
    "- 诚实的比较是第二个数：同一个模型在**没洗过的** 20 万行上评估，是 **0.5491**。也就是说，在原始分布上，清洗过的模型**反而更差**，那点提升完全消失。\n",
    "\n",
    "**为什么？** 清洗只是把几千行病态数据的杠杆砍掉，让模型对\"典型行程\"更讲道理；但这些病态行在真正的测试集里照样存在，所以测试集上的分数不会因此变好。这正是题目提醒的那句话：**清洗训练集不一定能提升测试集上的质量**。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "现在数据里有很多类别特征。类别特征里可能包含**罕见类别**，这通常是不好的：模型会在这些只出现几次的类别上严重过拟合。请把罕见类别合并成一个（比如统一记成 -1）。当然，只对**真正罕见**的类别这么做。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:32:34.023699Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:32:34.023512Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:32:34.140221Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:32:34.138854Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "start_cell categories: 84\n",
      "end_cell categories:   114\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def group_rare(frame, cols, min_share=1e-3):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Replace categories met in less than min_share of the rows with -1.\"\"\"\n",
    "    frame = frame.copy()\n",
    "    for col in cols:\n",
    "        counts = frame[col].value_counts()\n",
    "        rare = counts[counts < min_share * len(frame)].index\n",
    "        frame.loc[frame[col].isin(rare), col] = -1\n",
    "    return frame\n",
    "\n",
    "X = group_rare(X, [\"start_cell\", \"end_cell\"], min_share=1e-3)\n",
    "print(\"start_cell categories:\", X[\"start_cell\"].nunique())\n",
    "print(\"end_cell categories:  \", X[\"end_cell\"].nunique())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：`group_rare` 把罕见类别合并。\n",
    "> - `counts = frame[col].value_counts()`：统计每个类别出现多少次。\n",
    "> - `rare = counts[counts < min_share * len(frame)].index`：挑出\"出现比例低于 0.1%\"的那些类别名。\n",
    "> - `frame.loc[frame[col].isin(rare), col] = -1`：把这些类别的值统一改成 -1。\n",
    "> - `frame.copy()`：先复制再改，不改动传进来的原表（好习惯）。\n",
    "> - 这样做的效果：原来几百个格子编号，现在只剩几十个\"常见格子\"+一个\"其他\"。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在清洗后的数据上训练模型，并计算它在测试样本上的质量。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**任务 14（1 分）**。做完独热编码之后，数据集的特征数量会大幅增加。请数出编码**前**和编码**后**各有多少个特征。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:32:34.141994Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:32:34.141766Z",
