   ],
   "source": [
    "alphas = np.logspace(-5, 0, 6)\n",
    "\n",
    "train_idx, val_idx = train_test_split(np.arange(len(X)), test_size=0.2, random_state=42)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Lasso is expensive on the full 1.2 M rows, so the grid is searched on a random\n",
    "# subsample of the training part; the winners are then refitted on everything.\n",
    "rs = np.random.RandomState(0)\n",
    "sub = rs.choice(train_idx, size=200_000, replace=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "ridge_grid, lasso_grid = [], []\n",
    "for a in alphas:\n",
    "    _, s_r = fit_score(Ridge(alpha=a), num_now, cat_now,\n",
    "                       X.iloc[sub], y.iloc[sub], X.iloc[val_idx], y.iloc[val_idx])\n",
    "    _, s_l = fit_score(Lasso(alpha=a, max_iter=1000, tol=1e-3, selection=\"random\", random_state=0),\n",
    "                       num_now, cat_now, X.iloc[sub], y.iloc[sub], X.iloc[val_idx], y.iloc[val_idx])\n",
    "    ridge_grid.append(s_r)\n",
    "    lasso_grid.append(s_l)\n",
    "    print(f\"alpha={a:9.1e}  ridge valid={s_r:.4f}  lasso valid={s_l:.4f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "best_alpha_ridge = float(alphas[int(np.argmin(ridge_grid))])\n",
    "best_alpha_lasso = float(alphas[int(np.argmin(lasso_grid))])\n",
    "print(\"best alpha, Ridge:\", f\"{best_alpha_ridge:.1e}\", \" Lasso:\", f\"{best_alpha_lasso:.1e}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "_, rmsle_ridge_best = evaluate(num_now, cat_now, model=Ridge(alpha=best_alpha_ridge),\n",
    "                               label=f\"Ridge, best alpha={best_alpha_ridge:.1e}\")\n",
    "_, rmsle_lasso_best = evaluate(num_now, cat_now,\n",
    "                               model=Lasso(alpha=best_alpha_lasso, max_iter=2000, tol=1e-4,\n",
    "                                           selection=\"random\", random_state=0),\n",
    "                               label=f\"Lasso, best alpha={best_alpha_lasso:.1e}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：在验证集上搜索超参数。\n",
    "> - `np.logspace(-5, 0, 6)`：生成 6 个**对数等距**的数（10⁻⁵ 到 10⁰）。正则化参数通常按数量级搜索，所以用 logspace 而不是 linspace。\n",
    "> - `train_test_split(np.arange(len(X)), test_size=0.2, random_state=42)`：这次切的是**行号**，不是数据本身——这样后面可以用同一个索引去取 X 和 y。\n",
    "> - `rs.choice(..., size=200_000)`：从训练部分随机抽 20 万行。因为 Lasso 在 120 万行上要跑很久，用子样本搜参数、再用全量数据重训，是常见的工程折中。\n",
    "> - 循环里对每个 α 训练一次 Ridge、一次 Lasso，记录验证分数。\n",
    "> - `float(alphas[int(np.argmin(ridge_grid))])`：`argmin` 找出分数最小的位置，再取对应的 α。\n",
    "> - 最后用最优 α 在全量训练集上重训，并在测试集上评估。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "对 Lasso 的每一个 `alpha`，统计模型里**零权重的数量**，并把它对 `alpha` 画出曲线。如果想让至少一半的特征消失（权重变 0），我们要在质量上损失多少？"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**讲解与答案**\n",
    "\n",
    "**零权重比例随 α 增长。** 实测：α=1e-5 时 2.4%，1e-4 时 20%，1e-3 时 66%，1e-2 时 97.6%，1e-1 起 100%。也就是说，要让一半以上的特征消失，得沿网格往上挪**两个数量级**（1e-5 → 1e-3），此时 66% 的系数已经精确为 0。\n",
    "\n",
    "**代价是多少？** 验证集 RMSLE 从 0.3420 涨到 0.3533，**多损失约 0.011**。\n",
    "\n",
    "**怎么理解这个数？** 0.011 大约是 1% 的相对误差。对竞赛来说这很致命（排行榜上差几百名），但对\"我想知道哪几个特征真正重要\"这种需求来说，完全值得。\n",
    "\n",
    "**又一次同样的取舍：** 稀疏模型换来可解释性，代价是精度。"
   ]
  },
