     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Ridge + Manhattan distance                    RMSLE = 0.3374\n",
      "delta versus haversine only: -0.0015\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "num16 = list(num_now) + [\"log_manhattan\"]\n",
    "pipe_mh, rmsle_mh = evaluate(num16, cat15, model=Ridge(alpha=best_alpha_ridge),\n",
    "                             label=\"Ridge + Manhattan distance\")\n",
    "print(f\"delta versus haversine only: {rmsle_mh - rmsle_route:+.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：把 `log_manhattan` 加进数值特征，重训并比较。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**任务 17（加分，2 分）**。用 [H3](https://github.com/uber/h3-py) 这个库实现一个转换器：把地图划分成**六边形网格**，并基于这个划分计算特征。\n",
    "\n",
    "特征可以有很多种：起点和终点相距多少个六边形、相邻六边形里的行程数和时长统计等等。\n",
    "\n",
    "注意：这个库的性能**强烈依赖**地图上的六边形数量（由分辨率参数决定）。请选一个能让代码在合理时间内跑完的分辨率。\n",
    "\n",
    "加上新特征后测量质量。如果能把误差降低 0.005，就额外给 0.5 分，最多 2 分。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T21:35:06.078801Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-20T21:35:06.078644Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-20T21:35:09.512431Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-20T21:35:09.510986Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "unique hexagons, start: 750  end: 1975\n",
      "unique hex pairs: 41533\n",
      "count    1.411495e+06\n",
      "mean     4.241178e+00\n",
      "std      4.797252e+00\n",
      "min      0.000000e+00\n",
      "25%      2.000000e+00\n",
      "50%      3.000000e+00\n",
      "75%      5.000000e+00\n",
      "max      7.900000e+01\n",
      "Name: h3_distance, dtype: float64\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import h3\n",
    "\n",
    "RES = 8   # roughly 0.5 km hexagons\n",
    "\n",
    "X[\"h3_start\"] = [h3.latlng_to_cell(a, b, RES) for a, b in\n",
    "                 zip(coords[\"pickup_latitude\"].to_numpy(), coords[\"pickup_longitude\"].to_numpy())]\n",
    "X[\"h3_end\"] = [h3.latlng_to_cell(a, b, RES) for a, b in\n",
    "               zip(coords[\"dropoff_latitude\"].to_numpy(), coords[\"dropoff_longitude\"].to_numpy())]\n",
    "\n",
    "pairs = pd.Series([f\"{a}|{b}\" for a, b in zip(X[\"h3_start\"], X[\"h3_end\"])])\n",
    "unique_pairs = pairs.drop_duplicates()\n",
    "dist = {p: h3.grid_distance(*p.split(\"|\")) for p in unique_pairs}\n",
    "X[\"h3_distance\"] = pairs.map(dist).astype(float)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"unique hexagons, start:\", X[\"h3_start\"].nunique(), \" end:\", X[\"h3_end\"].nunique())\n",
    "print(\"unique hex pairs:\", len(unique_pairs))\n",
    "print(X[\"h3_distance\"].describe())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **代码讲解**：H3 特征。\n",
    "> - `h3.latlng_to_cell(lat, lng, 8)`：把经纬度转成六边形编号。分辨率 8 对应约 0.5 公里的格子。列表推导式对 120 万行逐个调用，大约需要几秒。\n",
    "> - `f\"{a}|{b}\"`：把起点格和终点格拼成一个键。\n",
    "> - `.drop_duplicates()` 取出所有**不重复**的格子对（可能只有几万个），只对这些算 `h3.grid_distance`——如果对每一行都算，会慢得离谱。\n",
    "> - `pairs.map(dist)`：用字典把\"算好的距离\"映射回每一行（`map` 查字典是向量化的）。\n",
    "> - `.astype(float)`：转成浮点，便于进模型。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
